          "why_it_matters": "The center of gravity is mouse on the keys turning a twentieth anniversary into a change of form rather than a retrospective: the trio is expanding midnight into image and space with Shuntaro Tsuneta on violin and rokapenis on visuals. Placed between Hania Rani's synth-and-exposed-piano Chilling Bambino persona and Ryoichi Kurokawa's precision two-screen -nD, the night becomes a coherent argument about how instruments, repetition and electronics can alter perception when sound is treated as physical space.",
